{
  "_note": "单站点详情:大字点击 → 28 天大图 → 四指标 → **热门搜索词 Top 8** → 这个站点的三张真卡。\n热门搜索词是 v9 整包都没有的东西 —— 它恰恰是 Search Console 最有价值的那一维(「别人搜什么找到我」),而三张卡都装不下一张表。\n⚠️ root **不写同名 `params` 兜底**:节点显式 params 覆盖继承作用域,而路由 query 走的是最低优先级的 ambient scope —— 写了兜底就是「点谁进来都渲同一个站」,且不报错。",
  "type": "page",
  "id": "gsc-site",
  "root": {
    "type": "container",
    "id": "root",
    "title": "${label}",
    "layout": "list",
    "direction": "vertical",
    "gap": "10pt",
    "_notePad": "左右内边距恒 **14pt**(page-design-system.md §5)。上下留白读 `@contentInset`(= @safeArea + 容器 chrome 占位 + 键盘),不是写死的数 —— 容器的 ···/✕ 胶囊**浮在内容之上**。",
    "padding": "14pt",
    "paddingTop": "${@contentInset.top}pt",
    "paddingBottom": "24pt",
    "_note": "页面级 depends:一个站点五连发(汇总 + 逐日 + 热门词 + 环比两段),四块面板与查询表共用。",
    "depends": [
      {
        "flow": "@[file://page/flow/site.df]",
        "params": {
          "u": "${u}",
          "_cache": 1
        },
        "_note": "§D 纯显式:裸 `@[file://…]` 字符串绑定**传空入参**。`_cache:1` = 开首屏缓存(§5.5 / G23),开关默认关故必须显式写。"
      }
    ],
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "Canvas",
        "id": "head",
        "h": "62pt",
        "canvas": {
          "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-shead.rcn]"
        }
      },
      {
        "_note": "空参兜底(2026-08-27 深链评审第二批;2026-09-01 收进生成器 —— 0530f3f 那轮是手改产物,被 3496988 的生成器重跑盖掉过一次,真源必须在这里):组件卡未绑定对象时点进来路由参数为空 —— 此前整页对着空参取数,是一页空骨架的死页。判据直接吃路由 query(展开期可用,不依赖 depends 时序,无闪现;web 引擎 depends 未回时子树本就不渲):为空渲 p-unbound 提示(结构照 G9,整卡可点回首页),非空走原内容。⚠️ 判空用 gt::(length::(x),0) —— 路由 query 恒是字符串,length:: 对字符串四端一致(对数字才分叉,memory [[vparser-engine-pitfalls]]);卡片深链恒带空值键(如 ?u=),不会落进「键整个缺席 → ${} 原样透传」那个形态。",
        "op": "if",
        "props": {
          "cond": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${u}),0),0,1)]"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "unbound",
            "h": "132pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-unbound.rcn]"
            },
            "events": {
              "onClick": "numable://self"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "op": "if",
        "props": {
          "cond": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${u}),0),1,0)]"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "chero",
            "h": "132pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/c-hero.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "cchart",
            "h": "164pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/c-chart.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "cstats",
            "h": "104pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/c-stats.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "secQuery",
            "h": "28pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-sec-query.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "_note": "定长 8 行按 qn 截断。热度条的宽度已在 `.df` 里算成像素 —— 尺寸字段吃不下方法(memory [[rcn-size-fields-no-methods]])。",
            "op": "forEach",
            "props": {
              "items": "${qlist}",
              "key": "q",
              "index": "i"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "op": "if",
                "props": {
                  "cond": "$[if::(lt::(${i},${qn}),1,0)]"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Canvas",
                    "id": "q-${i}",
                    "h": "42pt",
                    "canvas": {
                      "source": "@[file://page/rc/c-query.rcn]"
                    },
                    "params": {
                      "k": "${q.k}",
                      "c": "${q.c}",
                      "w": "${q.w}"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_note": "加卡入口 = **一个按钮**(§8.1a):这一页讲的就是这个对象,候选**逐项**带上它 —— 一份共享 override 只喂给面板当前那一张。",
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "addBtn",
            "h": "56pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-addbtn.rcn]"
            },
            "events": {
              "onClick": {
                "flow": "@[file://page/flow/pick-site.af]",
                "params": {
                  "site": "${site}",
                  "label": "${label}"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "foot",
            "h": "132pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-foot.rcn]"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "events": {
      "_note": "`onLoad`:三态的中间那一行 —— 首屏若渲的是旧货就后台校新一次(gate 全生命周期恰好一次、软重载不重置,不会自激;⚠️ 别改挂 onVisible)。",
      "onLoad": [
        {
          "flow": "@[file://page/flow/site-revalidate.af]",
          "params": {
            "stale": "${_stale}",
            "ckey": "${ckey}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "onRefresh": "@[file://page/flow/site-refresh.af]"
    }
  }
}
